								<p class="newsTitle">
									Carrying the torch - 
									11/5/2004 9:33:23 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									So its coming up on the first month of Awakened Fires birth as a guild and as a family of friends coming together. Asking what have we really done these past few weeks is an easy question. Elder god kills two and upwards of four times over. Taking a camping trip to OOW and saying hi to a few old friends there like Bonecracker and The hive queen, and then there was the discovery that Freja does have man boobs, and male dwarfs stand infront of female woodelves for a reason. But we will save that after we have further proof. <br /><br />The guild as a whole is strong, new and old members alike have now gotten into PoTime, with the help of our friends Noc Souls - saying hi to phase 4 the first time out to test the new mix. My thoughts on PoTime - as anyone would say its a loot farm, but wow the first time in can be exciting. <br /><br />The other day we took BoneCracker down in OOW. Several members had never done this encounter before. Was ammusing to see the first AE go off and everyone fiegn death. You could tell who had done this before and who had not real quick. Over all we won - duh.... Our direction is very clear. Ikk and Uqua, it will take afew weeks a we are building the flag base again, but we will be there - count on that. <br /><br />I'm going to keep&nbsp;this first news portion short and sweet. Come on back this time next month and i will have more to report and silly screenshots to insert as my screenshot button and fraps button are constantly going. Heck, maybe with some luck i will get some space to start doing the EQ movies again and show you what we have been upto - close and personal like. Till then<br /><br /><br />Kayrissa
								</div>
