								<p class="newsTitle">
									Our First Victim!!! - 
									10/20/2004 11:38:22 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<h1> <center></h1> <h2> <table width="100%" border="5"> <tbody> <tr> <td><img src="/pics/2151/xegony.jpg" /></td> <td> <p><font color="#f5f5dc">With our newly acquired guild tag we started our quest to flag our new members as well as our friends in Nocturnal Souls up for Time. First stop was the dreaded Plane of Air and its lovely Queen Xegony. After a long setup time and some discussion with regards to the strategy we used the last time we killed her well over a year and a half ago we were standing over Xegony’s corpse. I would much rather post a shot of her broken and battered body, but alas in all the commotion I neglected to take a screenshot. So the perfectly live Xegony will have to do for now. However Nueny was able to pry that pretty little wand out of Xegony’s cold dead hands!!!</font></p> <p><font color="#f5f5dc">&nbsp;Grats all on a job well done!!! </font></p></td></tr></tbody></table></h2></center>
								</div>
							</td>
