	</tr><tr>
		<td align="Center">
								<p class="newsTitle">
									Kay's Thoughts - 
									10/20/2004 1:40:42 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p>It wasn't that long ago when i joined into the real raiding guilds on E'ci. I for one missed the haydays of the server firsts and being involved with those kills. But i did get to be part of what i believe to be the best guild on Eci. Recon for me was a dream come true and while it only lasted mere months before the great dragon was put to rest and its members finally parted ways, i got a second chance at making something great. Awakened Fires was finally born on 10-18-04. A band of former Reconstructed and a few friends not wanting to fade into the closing lights decided to kick the mule in the rear just one more time. </p> <p>To me, Awakened Fires has many meanings, to the casual observer it is a re-ignition of a former spark. To me, it is a rekindling of a spark that once burned hotter then the norrath sun itself. Awkened Fires to anyone in game is just a name - now. But with some hard work, focus and the right mix, maybe we can breath life into an idea, into a dream that drives us to play this game. I know we can do that. In the first night alone 30 people were guild invited - not just a hosh posh of people, but former Reconstructed, former PM's and new people wishing to carry on the dream. We are receiving applications daily and filling in the numbers. Raids have started, epics are being found and plans to move forward laid out. Will it be an easy ride? no.... </p> <p>Will we have to revisit some of the lesser fights? sure we will, will we raid PoTime - we do that already. Will we be seen in uqua and beyond? you bet. Personally i hope a day comes when a person seing the Awakened Fires tag over my head treats me with the same love, hate, wonder and awe that i saw for the breif time i was in Recon. I know that day is coming and it is coming soon. So in the words of a western movie i love - "Skin that smoke wagon" or some words to that effect, cuz, im not gonna just stand there and bleed. </p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>Kayrissa<br />69th Ranger<br />Awakened Fires</p>
